Safeguards include interactive review for AI drafts, privacy exclusions,
do-not-contact controls, harassment screening, interaction budgets,
credential-safe errors, ambiguous-publication handling, and bounded optional
Bluesky Jetstream reception. Automatic likes, favourites, boosts, and reposts
are disabled.

